            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rimuovi e visualizza l'ultimo valore dell'array creando una variabile e impostando il suo valore su <code>themes.removeLast()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" current = themes.removeLast()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(current)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dark mode\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>current</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>themes.removeLast()</code>.</p></body></html>"
